# Styling

No NativeWind / styled-components. Use `StyleSheet` + shared tokens.

## Tokens

| Need | Source |
|------|--------|
| Colors | `@assets/colors` |
| Radii / shadows / type presets | `@utils/theme` |
| Scaled size/padding | `@utils/responsive` (`getWidth`, `getHeight`, …) |
| Icons / fonts / Lottie | `@assets/icons`, `@assets/fonts`, `@assets/animations` |

## Layout

Prefer existing shells: `MainContainer`, `ScreenWapper`, `ResponsiveContainer` — they handle safe area / padding / shared loaders where applicable.

## Do

- Match nearby screen StyleSheet patterns
- Reuse `AppButton`, `Header`, `CustomInput`, cards under `appComponent/` when they fit

## Do not

- Introduce a new CSS-in-JS or utility-class styling system
- Hard-code one-off hex values when `colors.js` already has the token
- Bypass responsive helpers for layout that must match other screens
